comments.body:
when you get this quest, these are the steps to take!

First go to Jaron Stoneshaper in starfal village, at 52,30;
Second go to the camp at 59,59 kill some owlbeasts and loot the crate;
Third go east from there to 60,60 where the wagon is and take the supplies, and go back to kill some more owlbeasts for the amulet (random drop).

After this go back to Jaron Stoneshaper and finish quest (I got 6600 xp and 100 IF reputation for it)
